@startuml
!theme plain
title Provider-neutral E2E Payment Sequence (Educational Reference)
actor Customer
participant Merchant
participant "Payment Platform" as Platform
participant "Processor Adapter" as Adapter
participant "External Processor" as Processor
participant "Payer Bank" as Bank
Customer -> Merchant : initiate checkout
Merchant -> Platform : create payment intent (idempotency key)
Platform -> Platform : persist intent and attempt
Platform -> Adapter : register payment attempt
Adapter -> Processor : submit instruction
Processor --> Adapter : accepted / pending + reference
Adapter --> Platform : external reference
Platform --> Merchant : pending + checkout action
Customer -> Bank : authorize in bank channel
Bank -> Processor : execution / rail result
Processor --> Adapter : status event
Adapter --> Platform : authenticated callback
Platform -> Platform : dedupe + guarded state transition
Platform --> Merchant : outcome webhook via outbox
Merchant --> Customer : show outcome
opt Callback delayed or missing
 Platform -> Adapter : query attempt status
 Adapter -> Processor : authoritative status enquiry
 Processor --> Adapter : current state
 Adapter --> Platform : recovery result
end
@enduml